ot;rgb(15, 17, 17)\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;1× Useful Dust Bag \u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;m98a7439l8ewq6v0lqf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;list\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;listId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;9bos9z1dtmv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;level\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;isTaskList\u0026quot;:false,\u0026quot;isOrdered\u0026quot;:false,\u0026quot;listStyleType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;SCIR_ECIR_SREC\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;symbolStyle\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;sz\u0026quot;:10.5,\u0026quot;color\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;rgb(15, 17, 17)\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;listStyle\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;format\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;bullet\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;●\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;align\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;}}},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;sz\u0026quot;:10.5,\u0026quot;szUnit\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;pt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;color\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;rgb(15, 17, 17)\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;1× Instruction Manual\u0026quot;]]]]\" class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eNever get stranded again! A flat battery won't slow you down with a reliable car jump starter. Explore our Beta08 Portable Car Jump Starter High-Power 3000A with Multifunctional Lights for reliable, portable solutions and ensure a swift start every time!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWhat Buture Beta08 Jump Starter High-Power 3000A Can Do\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThis ultra-strong portable jump starter can get you back on the road when no one’s on the other end of the jumper cables, power your tools, and revive your dead devices via USB if no power supply is near. Charge the device at home or on the road, and feel safe knowing you have a backup light source during any emergency.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eBring Car Batteries Back to Life\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eBeta08 car jump starter is your solid backup on the road. The high 3000A peak current will allow you to quickly start even the powerful 9-liter gas or 8.5-liter diesel engines. It can quickly respond to various sudden car stalling problems to ensure that your journey is not hindered. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eCharge Multiple Devices Quickly\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eBeta08 car jump starter can serve as a high-capacity power bank. With a 16800mAh battery, it can quickly charge your cell phones, tablets, and other USB devices through its dual ports of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUSB output and USB-C input\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e, which are faster than standard chargers. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUltra-Bright LED Light\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eBeta08 car jump starter features a 300-lumen light with four modes: Lighting, White Strobe, Orange Strobe, and SOS. The flashlight can operate continuously for up to 48 hours, guiding \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eyou through the night or signaling for help\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e in any situation. The larger luminous area provides ample light, making it an invaluable tool in emergencies or on adventure trips. \u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWhy Choose Buture Beta08 Jump Starter High-Power 3000A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e3-in-1 Multi-Function Tool\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eMore than just a jump starter — the Beta08 combines three essential tools into one:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eA powerful jump starter\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eA portable power bank with dual USB outputs to charge phones,tablets, and more.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eA 300-lumen LED flashlight with multiple modes (steady, SCOS, strobe) for emergencies or nighttime use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHigh-Performance 3000A Peak Current\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eDelivers up to 3000A to jump-start 12V vehicles, including:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUp to 9.0L gas engines or 8.5L diesel engines\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePerfect for cars, trucks, SUVS, boats, motorcycles, and more\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e10-Fold Safety\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e Protection \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eSystem\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eEngineered for total safety with advanced protection features, including:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eReverse polarity protection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eOver-charge and over-discharge prevention\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eShort circuit and spark-proof design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eTemperature protection for operation in extreme conditions (-44°F to 140°F\/-20°C to 60°C)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eIntelligent Clamps with Smart Prompts\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThe included smart clamps feature:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAutomatic battery recognition\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eLED prompts to guide safe operation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAudible alerts for issues like reverse connection or poor contact\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eMakes jump-starting easy and safe-even for first-time users\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eRug\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eged, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eDurable, and Lightweight Design\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eBuilt with a waterproof, dustproof, and shock-resistant shell, the Beta08 is designed for:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eExtreme weather like rain, snow, and rough terrain\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eTravel and emergency kits\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eReliable performance in tough environments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eCompact design makes it easy to move and store.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWide Compatibility \u0026amp; Versatility\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUse it with a wide range of vehicles and equipment:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eCars, motorcycles, SUVs, pickup trucks, RVs, boats, snowmobiles, lawnmowers, and more\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eGreat for road trips, camping, or emergency roadside assistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e Low Maintenance, Long Standby\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUse any 5V\/2A or above adapter (not included) for recharge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eIf not in use, recharge it every 3 months to maintain optimal performance and extend battery life\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eAlways ready when you need it most\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eHow to Properly Start a Car with the Beta08 Jump Starter? \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eThree steps:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eStep 1. Plug in. Insert the smart clamps to the jump starter - wait for the indicator to flash green.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eStep 2. Clench it. Raise the hood of the car. Connect the clamps to car battery (red to +, black to -). The indicator will turn solid green if connected correctly.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eStep 3. Start the car. Go back to the vehicle and start the car engine within 30s of the indicator turning solid green. Remove the starter from the battery before driving.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eButure Beta08 Specifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ccolgroup\u003e \u003ccol width=\"251\"\u003e \u003ccol width=\"356\"\u003e \u003c\/colgroup\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eBattery Type\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eLithium Polymer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eVoltage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e12 Volts\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUSB-C Input\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e5V\/2A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eUSB Output\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e5V\/2.4A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eCompatible with Vehicle Type\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eALL\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eBattery Capacity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e16800 mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePeak Output Current\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e3000 Amps\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eOperation Temperature\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e-20℃~60℃ (-4℉~140℉)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eLED Light\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eLighting\/White Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWhat's In the Box\u003c\